Removing 'b' at index  results in a palindrome, so we print  on a new line.  Test Case 3: \"aaa\"  This string is already a palindrome, so we print ; however, , , and  are also all acceptable answers, as the string will still be a palindrome if any one of the characters at those indices are removed.","topics":[],"score":211692,"global_rank":275118},{"name":"dlauritzen/SqlRest","owner":"dlauritzen","html_url":"https://github.com/dlauritzen/SqlRest","stars":1,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Python","description":"A super-thin MySQL REST API","topics":[],"score":211686,"global_rank":275126},{"name":"jaedencca/Simple_Crawler","owner":"jaedencca","html_url":"https://github.com/jaedencca/Simple_Crawler","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":0,"issues":0,"language":"Python","description":"A web crawler to extract relevant point data from specified location","topics":[],"score":211684,"global_rank":275132},{"name":"jakenoc/MagicTheGraphening","owner":"jakenoc","html_url":"https://github.com/jakenoc/MagicTheGraphening","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":0,"issues":2,"language":"Python","description":"Magic: The Gathering analysis meets Graph Theory","topics":[],"score":211684,"global_rank":275134},{"name":"leoata/COMP581-Lab2","owner":"leoata","html_url":"https://github.com/leoata/COMP581-Lab2","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":0,"issues":0,"language":"Python","description":null,"topics":[],"score":211684,"global_rank":275137},{"name":"evan-lauer/CFD-Model","owner":"evan-lauer","html_url":"https://github.com/evan-lauer/CFD-Model","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":0,"issues":0,"language":"Python","description":null,"topics":[],"score":211684,"global_rank":275148},{"name":"Shak2000/SyntheticControlModelLab","owner":"Shak2000","html_url":"https://github.com/Shak2000/SyntheticControlModelLab","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":0,"issues":0,"language":"Python","description":null,"topics":[],"score":211684,"global_rank":275160},{"name":"krhash/bloom-filter","owner":"krhash","html_url":"h